# REST

## Login
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "",
    "password": "",
    "rememberMe": false
}

## Register
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstname": "",
    "lastname": "",
    "email": "",
    "password": ""
}

## Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": ""
}

## Profile
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/users/me
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
    id: ,
    firstname: "",
    lastname: "", 
    username: null, 
    email: "",
}